(694362, 73829, 3080, '<td valign="top">Commenting on abstract is gonna be a difficult thing.  That being said, I can''t really say much here, just that''s is a horribly out of focus photo of some flowers.  That does make it abstract, so it fits the challenge, but I don''t think I like it.  On my page of photos to vote on, this one jumps out of the page because all the other abstracts are in focus, but this is clearly out of focus to MAKE it abstract.  alright for the challenge, but not my cup of tea.  sorry</td>', 'Commenting on abstract is gonna be a difficult thing.  That being said, I can''t really say much here, just that''s is a horribly out of focus photo of some flowers.  That does make it abstract, so it fits the challenge, but I don''t think I like it.  On my page of photos to vote on, this one jumps out of the page because all the other abstracts are in focus, but this is clearly out of focus to MAKE it abstract.  alright for the challenge, but not my cup of tea.  sorry', '2004-05-03 01:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
