(694903, 73933, 15920, '<td valign="top">There are three scary things about this photo:<br/>1)  Someone felt there was a market and manufactured a statue of a dog with his leg raised to urinate.<br/>2)  You thought it was suitable subject matter for a photo contest.<br/>3)  I am still laughing so hard I feel obligated to give my first 10.  <br/>Thanks for this, it was a welcome break!</td>', 'There are three scary things about this photo:1)  Someone felt there was a market and manufactured a statue of a dog with his leg raised to urinate.2)  You thought it was suitable subject matter for a photo contest.3)  I am still laughing so hard I feel obligated to give my first 10.  Thanks for this, it was a welcome break!', '2004-05-03 09:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(694904, 73890, 15920, '<td valign="top">Cool title.</td>', 'Cool title.', '2004-05-03 09:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
