(694919, 73917, 15920, '<td valign="top">Not very abstract, BUT, a well formed title (I wasn''t aware that a good education was required for membership here at DPC, but it is refreshing), exceptional choice of colors and use of an overplayed waterdrop here.  Composition and focus are both spot on.  In otherwords, 10, despite the miss on the challenge.  <br/> <br/>Did I say the title was great?</td>', 'Not very abstract, BUT, a well formed title (I wasn''t aware that a good education was required for membership here at DPC, but it is refreshing), exceptional choice of colors and use of an overplayed waterdrop here.  Composition and focus are both spot on.  In otherwords, 10, despite the miss on the challenge.   Did I say the title was great?', '2004-05-03 09:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
