(695171, 72859, 2764, '<td valign="top">how wierd - I spent my childhood sleeping on a bottom bunk looking up at exactly this scene.  I have''t thought of it for 30 years - thanks for the memory - 7</td>', 'how wierd - I spent my childhood sleeping on a bottom bunk looking up at exactly this scene.  I have''t thought of it for 30 years - thanks for the memory - 7', '2004-05-03 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(695176, 73504, 5792, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure this is a hair clip. :) I like your idea and it is composed well. Your choice of background to support it is the strongest feature of this composition. Since this is a member challenge I would have cloned out most of the white specs to give it a cleaner look. Nice job.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure this is a hair clip. :) I like your idea and it is composed well. Your choice of background to support it is the strongest feature of this composition. Since this is a member challenge I would have cloned out most of the white specs to give it a cleaner look. Nice job.', '2004-05-03 12:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(695186, 73799, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice color abstract. I especially like the subtlety of interplay between primary and secondary colors. Nice focus and decent technical quality.</td>', 'Very nice color abstract. I especially like the subtlety of interplay between primary and secondary colors. Nice focus and decent technical quality.', '2004-05-03 12:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(695201, 72834, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice attempt. I don''t find the transition from light to dark is quite as striking as it could be. The darkest darks aren''t very dark. On my monitor, this image has lost a lot of detail in the file compression. I''m probably responding to that. I like the texture of whatever this is (fish eggs? water droplets?).</td>', 'This is a nice attempt. I don''t find the transition from light to dark is quite as striking as it could be. The darkest darks aren''t very dark. On my monitor, this image has lost a lot of detail in the file compression. I''m probably responding to that. I like the texture of whatever this is (fish eggs? water droplets?).', '2004-05-03 12:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(695202, 73934, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors and nicely blurred to make a beautiful abstract. The only major fault is the tiny white spec near the top. Clone that out and smudge slightly the mottled area to the left of the dark green on the right side of the frame and you''ll have yourself a great abstract.  It would look good next to most modern color abstracts you find in art galleries. I like this one a lot.</td>', 'Very pretty colors and nicely blurred to make a beautiful abstract. The only major fault is the tiny white spec near the top. Clone that out and smudge slightly the mottled area to the left of the dark green on the right side of the frame and you''ll have yourself a great abstract.  It would look good next to most modern color abstracts you find in art galleries. I like this one a lot.', '2004-05-03 12:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(695204, 73934, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice colours and vertical pattern, beautiful image.</td>', 'nice colours and vertical pattern, beautiful image.', '2004-05-03 12:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(695207, 73993, 7322, '<td valign="top">Glass (or shiny plastic) is a difficult subject to photograph without special lighting, particularly in spherical form. This looks like you relied on flash for your lighting and it shows in the distracting hot spots. My suggestion is to try this again and place some kind of light source to the side of the arrangement (even a strong flashlight might do the trick). The other suggestion is to use a much higher depth of field if possible. The spehres in the foreground are very out of focus. A shallow depth of field creates distance between the objects which tends to detract from the abstract quality of the image. From my understanding, an abstract image should look very 2D, rather than 3D. Better lighting and sharper focus would make the shapes more obvious and the design they create more powerful. I would also omit the gold speheres as they aren''t really adding anything to the overall effect.</td>', 'Glass (or shiny plastic) is a difficult subject to photograph without special lighting, particularly in spherical form. This looks like you relied on flash for your lighting and it shows in the distracting hot spots. My suggestion is to try this again and place some kind of light source to the side of the arrangement (even a strong flashlight might do the trick). The other suggestion is to use a much higher depth of field if possible. The spehres in the foreground are very out of focus. A shallow depth of field creates distance between the objects which tends to detract from the abstract quality of the image. From my understanding, an abstract image should look very 2D, rather than 3D. Better lighting and sharper focus would make the shapes more obvious and the design they create more powerful. I would also omit the gold speheres as they aren''t really adding anything to the overall effect.', '2004-05-03 13:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(695209, 72580, 7322, '<td valign="top">First let me just say, I love your title. Is it from a poem? This is a really pleasing abstract. I like the feathery  verticals and the softly blurred pastel background. This one works for me.</td>', 'First let me just say, I love your title. Is it from a poem? This is a really pleasing abstract. I like the feathery  verticals and the softly blurred pastel background. This one works for me.', '2004-05-03 13:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(695214, 74002, 5792, '<td valign="top">Evocative, attractive abstract. Good colors. Nice idea. There is a semicircular outline near the bottom of the frame that looks like a water spot that I would have cloned out.  Given your title, I might have used selective color to maximize the blackness of the blacks, blues and cyans to give it a darker background and a more "space like" feel. Terrific job, though... you are to be commended.</td>', 'Evocative, attractive abstract. Good colors. Nice idea. There is a semicircular outline near the bottom of the frame that looks like a water spot that I would have cloned out.  Given your title, I might have used selective color to maximize the blackness of the blacks, blues and cyans to give it a darker background and a more "space like" feel. Terrific job, though... you are to be commended.', '2004-05-03 13:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(695216, 73944, 7322, '<td valign="top">Well, I definitely have no idea what this is. I would suggest a less shallow depth of field. The blurred metal wire in the foreground is distracting. It detracts from the overall design the intesecting wires create and lessens the impact of the red and gold. I''m guessing all that foreground is some kind of shiny gold cloth. It is out of focus and the color is washed out (due to flash is my guess). The overall color isn''t so much gold as blah. A suggestion for lighting shiny fabric is to arrange it so that there are folds and then light it from the side and take the shot with a tripod if you need to, to avoid using the flash. <br/></td>', 'Well, I definitely have no idea what this is. I would suggest a less shallow depth of field. The blurred metal wire in the foreground is distracting. It detracts from the overall design the intesecting wires create and lessens the impact of the red and gold. I''m guessing all that foreground is some kind of shiny gold cloth. It is out of focus and the color is washed out (due to flash is my guess). The overall color isn''t so much gold as blah. A suggestion for lighting shiny fabric is to arrange it so that there are folds and then light it from the side and take the shot with a tripod if you need to, to avoid using the flash. ', '2004-05-03 13:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(695220, 73534, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like you, I think a flower fits any challenge topic! I might have made the colors brighter and applied noise reduction and smoothing to increase it''s abstract qualities.</td>', 'Like you, I think a flower fits any challenge topic! I might have made the colors brighter and applied noise reduction and smoothing to increase it''s abstract qualities.', '2004-05-03 13:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(695223, 73865, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good concept and nicely done.</td>', 'Good concept and nicely done.', '2004-05-03 13:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(695228, 73883, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and a great concept.</td>', 'Very well composed and a great concept.', '2004-05-03 13:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(695230, 73707, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think this might have looked more abstract without the fly. I like the fly in this photo (although it could be a bit more obvious. I think if you upped the contrast and fiddled with the hue/saturation levels, you would have a stronger design. Also, the bit of negative space along the right edge gives too much sense of depth and doesn''t really add to the overall design. I don''t see enough of a contast between the negative space created by the black and the shapes created by the rusty splotches.</td>', 'I think this might have looked more abstract without the fly. I like the fly in this photo (although it could be a bit more obvious. I think if you upped the contrast and fiddled with the hue/saturation levels, you would have a stronger design. Also, the bit of negative space along the right edge gives too much sense of depth and doesn''t really add to the overall design. I don''t see enough of a contast between the negative space created by the black and the shapes created by the rusty splotches.', '2004-05-03 13:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(695238, 73862, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t love it but I do like it. I like the luminescent mood.</td>', 'I don''t love it but I do like it. I like the luminescent mood.', '2004-05-03 13:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(695240, 74006, 5792, '<td valign="top">A good abstract. Nice interplay of colors. I would have titled this one "Springtime" because of the green and lavender. Good job.</td>', 'A good abstract. Nice interplay of colors. I would have titled this one "Springtime" because of the green and lavender. Good job.', '2004-05-03 13:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(695242, 73764, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is spooky and definitely abstract. It took me a second to figure out what this is. It looks like trick photography until you realize how simple it actually is.</td>', 'This is spooky and definitely abstract. It took me a second to figure out what this is. It looks like trick photography until you realize how simple it actually is.', '2004-05-03 13:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(695246, 73999, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if black and white (or is it duotone?) is working too hard here. The shallow depth of field (too much blurring in the front) doesn''t help. I have to say this isn''t a great effort. Better luck next time! :D</td>', 'I don''t know if black and white (or is it duotone?) is working too hard here. The shallow depth of field (too much blurring in the front) doesn''t help. I have to say this isn''t a great effort. Better luck next time! :D', '2004-05-03 13:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(695247, 73721, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m reminded of The Sea of Holes in The Yelllow Submarine movie. There''s some image quality lost in the file compression, it seems, so the effect isn''t quite as powerful as it should be. Still, it''s imaginative, shows good design sense, and  makes me wonder how it was done. Ah, and I just noticed all the shapes made an overall shape of a heart. Not sure why that didn''t jump out at me right away.</td>', 'I''m reminded of The Sea of Holes in The Yelllow Submarine movie. There''s some image quality lost in the file compression, it seems, so the effect isn''t quite as powerful as it should be. Still, it''s imaginative, shows good design sense, and  makes me wonder how it was done. Ah, and I just noticed all the shapes made an overall shape of a heart. Not sure why that didn''t jump out at me right away.', '2004-05-03 13:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(695248, 73946, 16318, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo!!</td>', 'Very interesting photo!!', '2004-05-03 13:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(695249, 73199, 7322, '<td valign="top">The piles of flaked paint detract from the abstract quality of this image. For me, an abstraction needs to have clear delineations between design elements. Perhaps if you swept the scene first? Shooting from directly above might be an improvement.</td>', 'The piles of flaked paint detract from the abstract quality of this image. For me, an abstraction needs to have clear delineations between design elements. Perhaps if you swept the scene first? Shooting from directly above might be an improvement.', '2004-05-03 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(695250, 73981, 7322, '<td valign="top">NICE! Great color, good lines. High marks from me!</td>', 'NICE! Great color, good lines. High marks from me!', '2004-05-03 13:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(695254, 73794, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good composition and colors. It might be even better with greater contrast.</td>', 'Good composition and colors. It might be even better with greater contrast.', '2004-05-03 13:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
