(695648, 73936, 7322, '<td valign="top">Was this effect done in the camera? It looks like a noise filter to me but. It''s a good image so I''ll vote based on that but I''m suspicious of how it was achieved.</td>', 'Was this effect done in the camera? It looks like a noise filter to me but. It''s a good image so I''ll vote based on that but I''m suspicious of how it was achieved.', '2004-05-03 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
