(695685, 73912, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Many of the abstract shots are flat but yours has nice depth. I really like your entry and hope you get a ribbon.  I can''t wait to find out what this is a picture of.</td>', 'Nice job!  Many of the abstract shots are flat but yours has nice depth. I really like your entry and hope you get a ribbon.  I can''t wait to find out what this is a picture of.', '2004-05-03 17:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
