(695767, 72580, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! We have a couple of tea whisks at home (which is the only reason I recognize this shape) and now I''m going to spend the rest of the day trying to take a picture as good as this one. I won''t succeed, but thanks for the idea. :-)</td>', 'Beautiful shot! We have a couple of tea whisks at home (which is the only reason I recognize this shape) and now I''m going to spend the rest of the day trying to take a picture as good as this one. I won''t succeed, but thanks for the idea. :-)', '2004-05-03 18:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
