(695779, 73446, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is just to ''blah'' for me. Looks like a blurry close-up of something red. Nothing is compelling my eye, despite the strong color.</td>', 'This is just to ''blah'' for me. Looks like a blurry close-up of something red. Nothing is compelling my eye, despite the strong color.', '2004-05-03 18:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(695781, 73977, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice strong diagonals. Good color and sharp focus overall. Good job.</td>', 'Nice strong diagonals. Good color and sharp focus overall. Good job.', '2004-05-03 18:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(695782, 72493, 19952, '<td valign="top">Love this shot! The lines are so dramatic that I think the transparent matte actually detracts a bit. You might want to try just a plain solid matte, or, if you want to extend the image into the matte, maybe you could make it black and then overlay just the veins of the leaf without any of the green, or some variant of that idea. Regardless, beautiful image - congrats!</td>', 'Love this shot! The lines are so dramatic that I think the transparent matte actually detracts a bit. You might want to try just a plain solid matte, or, if you want to extend the image into the matte, maybe you could make it black and then overlay just the veins of the leaf without any of the green, or some variant of that idea. Regardless, beautiful image - congrats!', '2004-05-03 18:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(695784, 73996, 7322, '<td valign="top">This evokes a nice mood. I like the isolation of the streetlamps against the twilight sky. Strong lines and negative space. Good job.</td>', 'This evokes a nice mood. I like the isolation of the streetlamps against the twilight sky. Strong lines and negative space. Good job.', '2004-05-03 18:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
