(695791, 72493, 18349, '<td valign="top">Looks like a leaf.</td>', 'Looks like a leaf.', '2004-05-03 18:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(695793, 73872, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good strong lines and nice sharp image even in the foreground. Looks kind of like the face of a fly. This image shows you know your stuff! Good job!</td>', 'Good strong lines and nice sharp image even in the foreground. Looks kind of like the face of a fly. This image shows you know your stuff! Good job!', '2004-05-03 18:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(695794, 73930, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like what is happening in the lower half of the frame but it becomes rather blah for me in the top half.</td>', 'I like what is happening in the lower half of the frame but it becomes rather blah for me in the top half.', '2004-05-03 18:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(695795, 72443, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think that black blob at the top could have been cropped out but overall this is quite successful.</td>', 'I think that black blob at the top could have been cropped out but overall this is quite successful.', '2004-05-03 18:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(695796, 73328, 19952, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2004-05-03 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(695797, 73765, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a good strong composition. The verticals are asymetrical which displays good design sense. The picture was framed dead on so the lines are truly vertical and the planes flatten out completely. Nice texture, good color. Looks like a great abstract painting. One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'This is a good strong composition. The verticals are asymetrical which displays good design sense. The picture was framed dead on so the lines are truly vertical and the planes flatten out completely. Nice texture, good color. Looks like a great abstract painting. One of my favorites so far.', '2004-05-03 18:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(695820, 73845, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and well done.  I like the way the colors are not repetitive and predictable.  Although it works in this composition, I''d like to see what it would do if it were not so centered.  Some of the whites are a bit bright.  Overall a very nice image that meets the challenge without a doubt.</td>', 'Very interesting and well done.  I like the way the colors are not repetitive and predictable.  Although it works in this composition, I''d like to see what it would do if it were not so centered.  Some of the whites are a bit bright.  Overall a very nice image that meets the challenge without a doubt.', '2004-05-03 19:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(695821, 73809, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color. Nice shot!</td>', 'Beautiful color. Nice shot!', '2004-05-03 19:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(695824, 73747, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, dramatic image. Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful, dramatic image. Congrats!', '2004-05-03 19:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(695825, 73709, 19608, '<td valign="top">Definitely an abstract in my opinion even though the guidance was "if you can tell what it is, it''s not."  No point deducted from me for not being an anstract.  It is well composed and a pleasing image.  My comments for improvement are:<br/>1) A stronger backlighting would add and 2) The larger veins are a bit soft because they are not quite on the same plane as the main leaf.  If you did not stop full down - f32, f45  - try it again if yu can.</td>', 'Definitely an abstract in my opinion even though the guidance was "if you can tell what it is, it''s not."  No point deducted from me for not being an anstract.  It is well composed and a pleasing image.  My comments for improvement are:1) A stronger backlighting would add and 2) The larger veins are a bit soft because they are not quite on the same plane as the main leaf.  If you did not stop full down - f32, f45  - try it again if yu can.', '2004-05-03 19:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(695828, 73943, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors that work well together.  The dark squares add a bit of mystery.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice colors that work well together.  The dark squares add a bit of mystery.  Well done.', '2004-05-03 19:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(695831, 73969, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection I presume and a wonderful abstract.  Colors work very well together.  The diagonal lines add a bit of tension.  Very well executed.</td>', 'Very nice reflection I presume and a wonderful abstract.  Colors work very well together.  The diagonal lines add a bit of tension.  Very well executed.', '2004-05-03 19:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(695835, 72654, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition - the gradual transition of brightness from bottom right to upper left is quite effective.</td>', 'Excellent composition - the gradual transition of brightness from bottom right to upper left is quite effective.', '2004-05-03 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(695837, 73953, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice black and white; I never even cosidered black and white for this challenge - but yours works very well.  To me it seems like a "metal flower".  I''d like to see the "center" part just a bit further to the left - but that''s a minor point.  Overall - great execution.</td>', 'Very nice black and white; I never even cosidered black and white for this challenge - but yours works very well.  To me it seems like a "metal flower".  I''d like to see the "center" part just a bit further to the left - but that''s a minor point.  Overall - great execution.', '2004-05-03 19:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(695845, 72801, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors are marvelous asare the textures.  Compositionally it is a bit unnerving for me.  I think I would be much happier about it if I could see the rest of the large gray/silver  shape at the bottom.  It may also be stronger if the grey/silver shape were positioned a bit more CCW in the image.  Overall though - this is a very stong submission, it should do well.</td>', 'The colors are marvelous asare the textures.  Compositionally it is a bit unnerving for me.  I think I would be much happier about it if I could see the rest of the large gray/silver  shape at the bottom.  It may also be stronger if the grey/silver shape were positioned a bit more CCW in the image.  Overall though - this is a very stong submission, it should do well.', '2004-05-03 19:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
