(695897, 73466, 7322, '<td valign="top">This really stretches the idea of ''abstract''. There really isn''t anything abstract about this skyline photo. There is no real strong design element happening in this image. It is a decently composed skyline and the lights around the houses at an interesting element but not in an abstract design sense. Technically, the focus could have been quite a bit sharper. There is a light of detail loss in the water. Low score is based mainly on failing to meet the challenge. Asthetically, it is a reasonably pleasing shot although not outstanding.</td>', 'This really stretches the idea of ''abstract''. There really isn''t anything abstract about this skyline photo. There is no real strong design element happening in this image. It is a decently composed skyline and the lights around the houses at an interesting element but not in an abstract design sense. Technically, the focus could have been quite a bit sharper. There is a light of detail loss in the water. Low score is based mainly on failing to meet the challenge. Asthetically, it is a reasonably pleasing shot although not outstanding.', '2004-05-03 19:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(695899, 73328, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the way the repeating dots have been captured in the water droplet.</td>', 'I like the way the repeating dots have been captured in the water droplet.', '2004-05-03 19:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(695906, 73985, 7322, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really pop in a fresh or interesting way. The colors are nice not strong enough to make a cohesive statement. It lacks any other strong design element such as line, negative space, contrast...</td>', 'This doesn''t really pop in a fresh or interesting way. The colors are nice not strong enough to make a cohesive statement. It lacks any other strong design element such as line, negative space, contrast...', '2004-05-03 19:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(695908, 73575, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks a little fuzzy to me, A bit mroe contrast might have made it pop.</td>', 'This looks a little fuzzy to me, A bit mroe contrast might have made it pop.', '2004-05-03 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(695910, 73645, 18080, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites<br/>10</td>', 'one of my favorites10', '2004-05-03 19:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(695913, 73917, 7322, '<td valign="top">A great deal of the space below the water droplet is going to waste. Cropping would help this quite a bit. I like how the lines are repeated in the reflection.</td>', 'A great deal of the space below the water droplet is going to waste. Cropping would help this quite a bit. I like how the lines are repeated in the reflection.', '2004-05-03 20:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(695914, 73933, 18403, '<td valign="top">Just because its cute!!!  6</td>', 'Just because its cute!!!  6', '2004-05-03 20:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(695915, 73771, 7322, '<td valign="top">There isn''t a lot going on here. There is good use of negative and positive space and the colors harmonize but the grainy quality isn''t working hard enough and those hot spots are just distracting.</td>', 'There isn''t a lot going on here. There is good use of negative and positive space and the colors harmonize but the grainy quality isn''t working hard enough and those hot spots are just distracting.', '2004-05-03 20:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(695916, 73966, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good color. Good lighting. Nice design. Doesn''t wow me so I give it a 6.</td>', 'Good color. Good lighting. Nice design. Doesn''t wow me so I give it a 6.', '2004-05-03 20:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(695920, 73720, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a photographic representation of something that has an abstract appearance. The photo itself is not abstract. Way off the mark in terms of meeting the challenge. As a photo, on it''s own merits, its pretty boring other than as a factual recording of an interesting stump.</td>', 'This is a photographic representation of something that has an abstract appearance. The photo itself is not abstract. Way off the mark in terms of meeting the challenge. As a photo, on it''s own merits, its pretty boring other than as a factual recording of an interesting stump.', '2004-05-03 20:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(695923, 72750, 7322, '<td valign="top">A bit more detail in the squash would have gone a long way toward making this succesful. As it is, all that out of focus area of the image plane (due to the shallow depth of field) is going to waste.</td>', 'A bit more detail in the squash would have gone a long way toward making this succesful. As it is, all that out of focus area of the image plane (due to the shallow depth of field) is going to waste.', '2004-05-03 20:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
