(696071, 73916, 19568, '<td valign="top">This is a true abstract. Impossible to identify. Plus, this is reflected in its content as the colors all blend into a foggy unknown.   let me guess...the brooklyn bridge in a heavy fog.</td>', 'This is a true abstract. Impossible to identify. Plus, this is reflected in its content as the colors all blend into a foggy unknown.   let me guess...the brooklyn bridge in a heavy fog.', '2004-05-03 21:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
