(696106, 73888, 20324, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I like the calming green color and how it doesnt look modified. Is it a photo of something in the water? (9)</td>', 'Very nice composition. I like the calming green color and how it doesnt look modified. Is it a photo of something in the water? (9)', '2004-05-03 21:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
