(696130, 73996, 14053, '<td valign="top">Abstracts are about lines, shapes and colors. If it is recognizable as an object - it is not an abstract.</td>', 'Abstracts are about lines, shapes and colors. If it is recognizable as an object - it is not an abstract.', '2004-05-03 21:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(696135, 73403, 14053, '<td valign="top">Abstracts are about lines, shapes and colors. If it is recognizable as an object - it is not an abstract.</td>', 'Abstracts are about lines, shapes and colors. If it is recognizable as an object - it is not an abstract.', '2004-05-03 21:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(696144, 73624, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great composition! And for once the trame helps, But somehow the subject doesn''t affect me much, it  seems not quite abstract enough, or maybe just the opposite, it doesn''t tell enough of a story?</td>', 'Great composition! And for once the trame helps, But somehow the subject doesn''t affect me much, it  seems not quite abstract enough, or maybe just the opposite, it doesn''t tell enough of a story?', '2004-05-03 21:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(696162, 73893, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I think I''d prefer more saturation (and maybe more contrast), or just B&amp;W</td>', 'Good idea, but I think I''d prefer more saturation (and maybe more contrast), or just B&W', '2004-05-03 21:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(696173, 73977, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting (especially the lines of highlights) and selective DOF - 8</td>', 'Very nice lighting (especially the lines of highlights) and selective DOF - 8', '2004-05-03 22:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(696184, 73988, 7485, '<td valign="top">Still have no idea what the title refers to, but love the photo. Only complaint is the halo outside the rim, a sharpening artifact?</td>', 'Still have no idea what the title refers to, but love the photo. Only complaint is the halo outside the rim, a sharpening artifact?', '2004-05-03 22:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(696194, 73833, 18191, '<td valign="top">Repitition is good in abstaction!</td>', 'Repitition is good in abstaction!', '2004-05-03 22:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(696198, 73993, 7485, '<td valign="top">I think it would have worked better with a more selective DOF, say with only one line of balls in focus. Or with all of them in focus. As is, there seems no pattern to what''s in focus and what isn''t.</td>', 'I think it would have worked better with a more selective DOF, say with only one line of balls in focus. Or with all of them in focus. As is, there seems no pattern to what''s in focus and what isn''t.', '2004-05-03 22:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(696205, 72654, 7485, '<td valign="top">Best one so far by a big margin! The highlights on the ridges work beatuifully again the black background. 10</td>', 'Best one so far by a big margin! The highlights on the ridges work beatuifully again the black background. 10', '2004-05-03 22:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(696214, 73575, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I don''t like the lack of dark shadows, it looks too hazy</td>', 'Good idea, but I don''t like the lack of dark shadows, it looks too hazy', '2004-05-03 22:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(696224, 73961, 7485, '<td valign="top">I like the glistening, but I''m thinking more contrast and deeper shadows would be a big improvement</td>', 'I like the glistening, but I''m thinking more contrast and deeper shadows would be a big improvement', '2004-05-03 22:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(696242, 73452, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully simple and sci-fi looking. But it looks like the photo was rotated and put on a black background, the outside edges of the original rotated photo are too visible (and no, my monitor is not out of calibration!). 8, would be a 10 without the seems.</td>', 'Wonderfully simple and sci-fi looking. But it looks like the photo was rotated and put on a black background, the outside edges of the original rotated photo are too visible (and no, my monitor is not out of calibration!). 8, would be a 10 without the seems.', '2004-05-03 22:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(696251, 73513, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent abstract architecture shot, love the subtle gradients in the shadows. 8</td>', 'Excellent abstract architecture shot, love the subtle gradients in the shadows. 8', '2004-05-03 22:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(696260, 73657, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photo.  It''s easy to get lost in and the color, light, shapes, and textures come together very nicely for a pleasing composition.  I like the masculinity here... great work.</td>', 'This is a fantastic photo.  It''s easy to get lost in and the color, light, shapes, and textures come together very nicely for a pleasing composition.  I like the masculinity here... great work.', '2004-05-03 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(696265, 73817, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! But I would have skewed the image to align the bricks with the frame, or tilted the whole thing so nothing lined up. 7</td>', 'Great idea! But I would have skewed the image to align the bricks with the frame, or tilted the whole thing so nothing lined up. 7', '2004-05-03 22:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(696274, 72503, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great sense of depth in an excellent composition! But the frame is too heavy and I''m not sure the filter (median?) is helpful. 7</td>', 'Great sense of depth in an excellent composition! But the frame is too heavy and I''m not sure the filter (median?) is helpful. 7', '2004-05-03 22:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(696275, 73883, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract.  Colors work very well together.  The varying rectangle sizes not being consistent gives it a nice randomness.  I wish all of the brightest areas were not so close to the outer edges, as they lead you out of the frame as is.  The very narrow border on the outside tends to mitigate this though - although normally I''m not a big fan of borders.</td>', 'Very nice abstract.  Colors work very well together.  The varying rectangle sizes not being consistent gives it a nice randomness.  I wish all of the brightest areas were not so close to the outer edges, as they lead you out of the frame as is.  The very narrow border on the outside tends to mitigate this though - although normally I''m not a big fan of borders.', '2004-05-03 22:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(696282, 73512, 19608, '<td valign="top">You''ve picked the perfect colors for this.  Very pleasant. I like the diagonal composition too.  But dummy me, I must be missing something on the title - but there''s no deduction for that.  It''s better than some that just said "abstract" for their title.  Nice job.</td>', 'You''ve picked the perfect colors for this.  Very pleasant. I like the diagonal composition too.  But dummy me, I must be missing something on the title - but there''s no deduction for that.  It''s better than some that just said "abstract" for their title.  Nice job.', '2004-05-03 22:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(696283, 73931, 7485, '<td valign="top">I''d like it a lot right side up and with a less distracting frame</td>', 'I''d like it a lot right side up and with a less distracting frame', '2004-05-03 22:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(696288, 73328, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Superb lighting and selective DOF. Only improvement I can think of would be to skip the close out-of-focus needle left of center. 8</td>', 'Very cool. Superb lighting and selective DOF. Only improvement I can think of would be to skip the close out-of-focus needle left of center. 8', '2004-05-03 22:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(696289, 73591, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea and some might "strage" shapes to make work together. The little light flare at the bottom of the globe and on the metal-looking thing add a nice touch,  I think my comment on how to improve the image would focus on the color of the background.  The dark gray doesn''t work as well for me as a warmer yellow or orangy hue would.</td>', 'Very interesting idea and some might "strage" shapes to make work together. The little light flare at the bottom of the globe and on the metal-looking thing add a nice touch,  I think my comment on how to improve the image would focus on the color of the background.  The dark gray doesn''t work as well for me as a warmer yellow or orangy hue would.', '2004-05-03 22:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(696298, 73143, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I really like the watery look of the center of the image below the boomerang.  My biggest complaint would be the very dark band at the top of the frame.  It would be better if it were the same color as the boomerang or eliminated altogether.</td>', 'Great colors.  I really like the watery look of the center of the image below the boomerang.  My biggest complaint would be the very dark band at the top of the frame.  It would be better if it were the same color as the boomerang or eliminated altogether.', '2004-05-03 22:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
