(696659, 72834, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea and the change of lighting from top to bottom is nice. The general poor quality of focus is the main distraction in this image.</td>', 'Good idea and the change of lighting from top to bottom is nice. The general poor quality of focus is the main distraction in this image.', '2004-05-04 02:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
