(697009, 73931, 12448, '<td valign="top">I see a shot from  an airplane or from a very high vantage point, rotated 90 degrees and bordered?  Do I win?   Interesting concept and different but not really appealing to me overall, sorry.   A 4</td>', 'I see a shot from  an airplane or from a very high vantage point, rotated 90 degrees and bordered?  Do I win?   Interesting concept and different but not really appealing to me overall, sorry.   A 4', '2004-05-04 12:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
