(697257, 72542, 18709, '<td valign="top">Just a thought!   Very good.  (Is it Brownian Motion)?  or something much more commonplace.   Anyway, it is unidentifiable, so that make it ''abstract'' for me.</td>', 'Just a thought!   Very good.  (Is it Brownian Motion)?  or something much more commonplace.   Anyway, it is unidentifiable, so that make it ''abstract'' for me.', '2004-05-04 15:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
