(697329, 73971, 18709, '<td valign="top">Intrigueing.  The only thing that comes to mind is an ''Anderson'' shelter, such as we had in wartime England.  It consisted of a short tunnel made of curved corrugated iron.  But your curve is really too shallow for that,it would have been too big. Good shot.</td>', 'Intrigueing.  The only thing that comes to mind is an ''Anderson'' shelter, such as we had in wartime England.  It consisted of a short tunnel made of curved corrugated iron.  But your curve is really too shallow for that,it would have been too big. Good shot.', '2004-05-04 16:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(697331, 72834, 18709, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sheet of pebbled glass, but I might be wrong.</td>', 'Looks like a sheet of pebbled glass, but I might be wrong.', '2004-05-04 16:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(697332, 73388, 4008, '<td valign="top">too much relying on editing to try to make it unrecognisable. But it still is just a dragonfly, I don''t enjoy it just as shapes and colors.</td>', 'too much relying on editing to try to make it unrecognisable. But it still is just a dragonfly, I don''t enjoy it just as shapes and colors.', '2004-05-04 16:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(697334, 73776, 4008, '<td valign="top">an abstract idea maybe, but not an abstract in the definition of this challenge. I don''t enjoy the image because of just its lines, shapes or colors.</td>', 'an abstract idea maybe, but not an abstract in the definition of this challenge. I don''t enjoy the image because of just its lines, shapes or colors.', '2004-05-04 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(697337, 73817, 4008, '<td valign="top">just reality, not an abstract in my opinion. Maybe if you had gone closer and just take a piece of a brick plus some paint it would have been.</td>', 'just reality, not an abstract in my opinion. Maybe if you had gone closer and just take a piece of a brick plus some paint it would have been.', '2004-05-04 16:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
