(697342, 73365, 4008, '<td valign="top">a slinky image, and sorry to say, not a very good one. A messy composition, unattractive B&amp;W. You could have used the reflections to add color, to confuse the shape. I don''t enjoy the shapes and colors here, just see a slinky.<br/> <br/>edited : corrected for spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-10 01:38:24.</i></td>', 'a slinky image, and sorry to say, not a very good one. A messy composition, unattractive B&W. You could have used the reflections to add color, to confuse the shape. I don''t enjoy the shapes and colors here, just see a slinky. edited : corrected for spelling', '2004-05-04 16:23:27.000000', '2004-05-10 02:38:24.000000', 1),
(697343, 73310, 4008, '<td valign="top">too much edge effect to be a picture.</td>', 'too much edge effect to be a picture.', '2004-05-04 16:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(697345, 73475, 4008, '<td valign="top">a good image, but not an abstract. Your choice of composition and sharpness makes this very recognisable, I enjoy the image as the flower, not just as shapes and colors.</td>', 'a good image, but not an abstract. Your choice of composition and sharpness makes this very recognisable, I enjoy the image as the flower, not just as shapes and colors.', '2004-05-04 16:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
