(697351, 73779, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is very abstract, but I don''t find quite enough interest. I think it needs <br/>something, I don''t know what.  Good shot though.</td>', 'This is very abstract, but I don''t find quite enough interest. I think it needs something, I don''t know what.  Good shot though.', '2004-05-04 16:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
