(697538, 73829, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors work well with the dark background.  Lots of JPEG artifacts kinda destroys the presentation. Keep trying.</td>', 'The colors work well with the dark background.  Lots of JPEG artifacts kinda destroys the presentation. Keep trying.', '2004-05-04 19:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(697539, 73631, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.</td>', 'Interesting concept.', '2004-05-04 19:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(697540, 72898, 19608, '<td valign="top">The image looks good in the slim jim format you''ve presented.</td>', 'The image looks good in the slim jim format you''ve presented.', '2004-05-04 19:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(697543, 73349, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful selection of colors that work well with each other.  I like the slight diagonal presentation. Although the selective focus is good, I''d like to see a bit more of the subject sharper. Black border doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'Wonderful selection of colors that work well with each other.  I like the slight diagonal presentation. Although the selective focus is good, I''d like to see a bit more of the subject sharper. Black border doesn''t add anything.', '2004-05-04 19:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(697546, 73466, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection.  The hints of color in the flags add a nice touch.  Abstract - well just maybe.</td>', 'Nice reflection.  The hints of color in the flags add a nice touch.  Abstract - well just maybe.', '2004-05-04 19:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(697548, 72728, 9780, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. I was going to say somthing about the dirt but after second look I like to have it there.</td>', 'Nice pic. I was going to say somthing about the dirt but after second look I like to have it there.', '2004-05-04 19:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(697549, 73125, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Your rainbow of colors is dynamic. I''d like to remove the two bright white spots - on on the left front of the ball and the other behind the left side.  Overall an excellent entry.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Your rainbow of colors is dynamic. I''d like to remove the two bright white spots - on on the left front of the ball and the other behind the left side.  Overall an excellent entry.', '2004-05-04 19:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(697551, 73475, 19608, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors, nicely composed.</td>', 'Vibrant colors, nicely composed.', '2004-05-04 19:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(697552, 73674, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice high key presentation.  your selection of colors excellent.</td>', 'Nice high key presentation.  your selection of colors excellent.', '2004-05-04 19:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(697558, 73926, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have no clue what this actually is...but it looks discusting.  Looks like skin with bloody puss filled lesions.  I have to say that with that image in my head, this is not appealing at all to me.  Your focus is alright, and this is definately abstract enough, but just nasty looking.  Sorry. ~Heather~</td>', 'I have no clue what this actually is...but it looks discusting.  Looks like skin with bloody puss filled lesions.  I have to say that with that image in my head, this is not appealing at all to me.  Your focus is alright, and this is definately abstract enough, but just nasty looking.  Sorry. ~Heather~', '2004-05-04 19:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(697561, 73841, 3080, '<td valign="top">? Is right.  It''s definately abstract.  It''s abstract and out of focus.  I can''t say that this photo really draws me in and makes me say ''woah...cool''.  No real exciting colors or shapes or patterns.  For lack of better word, boring.  Sorry.  ~Heather~</td>', '? Is right.  It''s definately abstract.  It''s abstract and out of focus.  I can''t say that this photo really draws me in and makes me say ''woah...cool''.  No real exciting colors or shapes or patterns.  For lack of better word, boring.  Sorry.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-04 19:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(697562, 73886, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s abstract, and it made me look at it for quite awhile trying to figure out what it could be. But it still doesn''t really interest me much.  Some good patterns, and I like how the same patterns repeat slightly throughout the photo.  Black and white is interesting here.  Definately better than the colored blobs I''m seeing many of. lol.  ~Heather~</td>', 'It''s abstract, and it made me look at it for quite awhile trying to figure out what it could be. But it still doesn''t really interest me much.  Some good patterns, and I like how the same patterns repeat slightly throughout the photo.  Black and white is interesting here.  Definately better than the colored blobs I''m seeing many of. lol.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-04 19:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(697563, 73512, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I love the colors.  focus and clarity are great.  the angle is wonderful.  The orange on blue is perfect.  I''d like to see this in the top 3.  Very nice.</td>', 'I love it.  I love the colors.  focus and clarity are great.  the angle is wonderful.  The orange on blue is perfect.  I''d like to see this in the top 3.  Very nice.', '2004-05-04 19:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(697564, 73227, 18709, '<td valign="top">The first photograph of a black hole.  Congrats. It looks good.</td>', 'The first photograph of a black hole.  Congrats. It looks good.', '2004-05-04 19:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(697565, 73452, 18709, '<td valign="top">O don''t know what it is.  Is it a telescope mirror, or something like that.  Whatever, <br/>it almost out-Saturns Saturn.</td>', 'O don''t know what it is.  Is it a telescope mirror, or something like that.  Whatever, it almost out-Saturns Saturn.', '2004-05-04 19:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(697568, 73970, 18709, '<td valign="top">We know what they are, but we''re not saying.   This makes a good shot.</td>', 'We know what they are, but we''re not saying.   This makes a good shot.', '2004-05-04 19:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(697570, 73865, 18709, '<td valign="top">Good colours, and a nice random mix of shapes.</td>', 'Good colours, and a nice random mix of shapes.', '2004-05-04 19:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(697573, 73207, 18709, '<td valign="top">This has a ''spacey'' feel.  Things rushing past at the speed of light.</td>', 'This has a ''spacey'' feel.  Things rushing past at the speed of light.', '2004-05-04 19:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(697574, 73993, 18709, '<td valign="top">Good imagery.  Fine colours.  Picture is well-judged.</td>', 'Good imagery.  Fine colours.  Picture is well-judged.', '2004-05-04 19:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(697576, 73883, 18709, '<td valign="top">Is it the window-panes distorting a building opposite.  I hope so, otherwise my eyes are going.  The whole thing looks like a wall of Art Nouveau tiles.   Very good.</td>', 'Is it the window-panes distorting a building opposite.  I hope so, otherwise my eyes are going.  The whole thing looks like a wall of Art Nouveau tiles.   Very good.', '2004-05-04 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(697577, 73365, 18709, '<td valign="top">Indeed.  A very nice image.  Well-lighted. Too easy to blind people with that shiny metal.</td>', 'Indeed.  A very nice image.  Well-lighted. Too easy to blind people with that shiny metal.', '2004-05-04 19:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(697578, 73464, 18709, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  I presume it is underwater, but lately I find I''m being wrong about many thingslike this, so I''ll leave it open.</td>', 'I like this image.  I presume it is underwater, but lately I find I''m being wrong about many thingslike this, so I''ll leave it open.', '2004-05-04 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(697580, 73978, 18709, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours, and all so luminous.  A bit too recognisable as the heart of a flower, otherwise very good indeed/</td>', 'Wonderful colours, and all so luminous.  A bit too recognisable as the heart of a flower, otherwise very good indeed/', '2004-05-04 19:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(697581, 73991, 18709, '<td valign="top">The colour here is everything.  And very good too.</td>', 'The colour here is everything.  And very good too.', '2004-05-04 19:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
