(702711, 72801, 3080, '<td valign="top">Since you''re having so much trouble with this shot, I thought I''d stop on in and comment.  First off, I''m not a huge fan of abstracts.  That being said, this one is alright.  The color is what does it for me.  I like the texture and patterns along with the color. Had I not gotten some inside info from the DQ request, I would not know what this is, but that''s ok.  Maybe that''s what makes it interesting.  The way you have positioned the sunglasses in the photo makes for a nice balance with the reflection and colors.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Since you''re having so much trouble with this shot, I thought I''d stop on in and comment.  First off, I''m not a huge fan of abstracts.  That being said, this one is alright.  The color is what does it for me.  I like the texture and patterns along with the color. Had I not gotten some inside info from the DQ request, I would not know what this is, but that''s ok.  Maybe that''s what makes it interesting.  The way you have positioned the sunglasses in the photo makes for a nice balance with the reflection and colors.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-05-06 21:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
