(703466, 73829, 8054, '<td valign="top">Hmm...I see an amoeba. I''m just kidding. But seriously, I don''t get it.</td>', 'Hmm...I see an amoeba. I''m just kidding. But seriously, I don''t get it.', '2004-05-07 02:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(703468, 73977, 8054, '<td valign="top">This would have scored much higher if the water spots were not there.</td>', 'This would have scored much higher if the water spots were not there.', '2004-05-07 02:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(703476, 73268, 8054, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement and subject. Lighting looks a bit flat making the rest of the image appear dull. Fiddle with the levels a bit as an experiment to enhance contrast.</td>', 'I like the arrangement and subject. Lighting looks a bit flat making the rest of the image appear dull. Fiddle with the levels a bit as an experiment to enhance contrast.', '2004-05-07 02:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(703483, 73872, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a slinky, er the Brain Impulse Galvanoscope Record And Transfer unit.  :)  I think your lighting was a bit harsh as evidenced in the center "hub" on the right side. If the light was muted somewhat and maybe even converted to b/w, this would be outstanding. Oh, and maybe make sure the hub is centered in the photo or that the whole image is symmetrical.</td>', 'Nice shot of a slinky, er the Brain Impulse Galvanoscope Record And Transfer unit.  :)  I think your lighting was a bit harsh as evidenced in the center "hub" on the right side. If the light was muted somewhat and maybe even converted to b/w, this would be outstanding. Oh, and maybe make sure the hub is centered in the photo or that the whole image is symmetrical.', '2004-05-07 02:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(703489, 72801, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10.</td>', 'Great 10.', '2004-05-07 02:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(703491, 73862, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice and really abstract.</td>', 'Very nice and really abstract.', '2004-05-07 02:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(703495, 73903, 8054, '<td valign="top">Heh, appropriate title! I like the warm glow of the lamp shades although the middle shade is showing some excessive compression. And there''s a weird spot in the upper left that could have been cloned out as well as the top of that shade. 7.</td>', 'Heh, appropriate title! I like the warm glow of the lamp shades although the middle shade is showing some excessive compression. And there''s a weird spot in the upper left that could have been cloned out as well as the top of that shade. 7.', '2004-05-07 03:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(703496, 73867, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot! I think it would have been better if it were taken closer to the grass.</td>', 'Great macro shot! I think it would have been better if it were taken closer to the grass.', '2004-05-07 03:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(703502, 73960, 8054, '<td valign="top">This image reminds me of a scene in "American Beauty" where the neighbor kid films a plastic bag. Anywho, it looks good but a bit over sharpened (the bag). Maybe because it is moving, hard to tell. Extra points for originality! 7</td>', 'This image reminds me of a scene in "American Beauty" where the neighbor kid films a plastic bag. Anywho, it looks good but a bit over sharpened (the bag). Maybe because it is moving, hard to tell. Extra points for originality! 7', '2004-05-07 03:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(703505, 73817, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks good in b/w. Very random splat pattern. I don''t know if the cropping works, however. I think if the splat was positioned higher in the image and if it was cropped more evenly it would look much better. Or if the photograph was taken level and then rotated, say, 45 degrees...might look good, too. Also, rule of thirds.</td>', 'Looks good in b/w. Very random splat pattern. I don''t know if the cropping works, however. I think if the splat was positioned higher in the image and if it was cropped more evenly it would look much better. Or if the photograph was taken level and then rotated, say, 45 degrees...might look good, too. Also, rule of thirds.', '2004-05-07 03:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(703509, 73865, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is cool! I like how patterns form in the sheet metal. I would have cloned out the yellow traffic signal thingy.</td>', 'This is cool! I like how patterns form in the sheet metal. I would have cloned out the yellow traffic signal thingy.', '2004-05-07 03:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(703519, 73852, 8054, '<td valign="top">I see the flowers a bit differently. I see 60''s style ''dos.  :) Great shot and DOF! 9 for extra abstractness.</td>', 'I see the flowers a bit differently. I see 60''s style ''dos.  :) Great shot and DOF! 9 for extra abstractness.', '2004-05-07 03:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(703521, 73898, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think the colors would have been better matched to a lighter colored background. And the bottom should have been cropped a bit more to eliminate the flexing portion of the straws or show more of them.</td>', 'I think the colors would have been better matched to a lighter colored background. And the bottom should have been cropped a bit more to eliminate the flexing portion of the straws or show more of them.', '2004-05-07 03:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(703522, 73850, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks like lichen on a rock but with very nice patterns and shapes. Good job capturing colors and textures. Unfortunately, not the most interesting image of the lot.</td>', 'Looks like lichen on a rock but with very nice patterns and shapes. Good job capturing colors and textures. Unfortunately, not the most interesting image of the lot.', '2004-05-07 03:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(703560, 72503, 6073, '<td valign="top">This is a love it or hate it border. It will be interesting to see if the voting splits.</td>', 'This is a love it or hate it border. It will be interesting to see if the voting splits.', '2004-05-07 05:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(703607, 73950, 18349, '<td valign="top">I can tell what they are.</td>', 'I can tell what they are.', '2004-05-07 06:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(703608, 73307, 5534, '<td valign="top">Intresting. Photo has some nice tones. 8</td>', 'Intresting. Photo has some nice tones. 8', '2004-05-07 06:20:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(703685, 73927, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Would have preferred a greater DOF</td>', 'Interesting image. Would have preferred a greater DOF', '2004-05-07 08:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(703690, 73883, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Very abstract. I like it.</td>', 'Nicely done. Very abstract. I like it.', '2004-05-07 08:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(703790, 73794, 7743, '<td valign="top">Tulips always have such wonderful colour.  The curved lines shown here give a sense of tranquility (IMO).  It might have worked even better without the stamen on the left. The DOF and exposure seem to be bang on. 7</td>', 'Tulips always have such wonderful colour.  The curved lines shown here give a sense of tranquility (IMO).  It might have worked even better without the stamen on the left. The DOF and exposure seem to be bang on. 7', '2004-05-07 10:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(703798, 72435, 7743, '<td valign="top">I get a great sense of depth from this image.  Well done with the DOF.  The main vertical bar seems a bit too central therefore making the image seem a little unbalanced.  Exposure is good.  Not blowing the highlights on reflective surfaces can sometimes be a challenge. 7</td>', 'I get a great sense of depth from this image.  Well done with the DOF.  The main vertical bar seems a bit too central therefore making the image seem a little unbalanced.  Exposure is good.  Not blowing the highlights on reflective surfaces can sometimes be a challenge. 7', '2004-05-07 10:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(703846, 73461, 15810, '<td valign="top">wow, top shot, love it</td>', 'wow, top shot, love it', '2004-05-07 10:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(703879, 73771, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of shallow DOF.  It might have worked better if only one point was in the band of actual focus.  The additional points of focus are a bit distracting.  Also, the transition from focus to out of focus seems a bit abrupt.  Maybe having a background that was slightly less blurred would of helped. 6<br/></td>', 'Interesting use of shallow DOF.  It might have worked better if only one point was in the band of actual focus.  The additional points of focus are a bit distracting.  Also, the transition from focus to out of focus seems a bit abrupt.  Maybe having a background that was slightly less blurred would of helped. 6', '2004-05-07 11:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(703885, 73207, 7743, '<td valign="top">The colours are nice, however, having the image a little less out of focus may have drawn them out more.  Also, it seems to be cropped slightly too much on the bottom. 6</td>', 'The colours are nice, however, having the image a little less out of focus may have drawn them out more.  Also, it seems to be cropped slightly too much on the bottom. 6', '2004-05-07 11:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(703889, 73328, 7743, '<td valign="top">The water droplet is clear and sharp.  Having it centered however seems to make the image rather static.  Maybe a different perspective (maybe at the level of the holes) could help make the image more dynamic as well. 6</td>', 'The water droplet is clear and sharp.  Having it centered however seems to make the image rather static.  Maybe a different perspective (maybe at the level of the holes) could help make the image more dynamic as well. 6', '2004-05-07 11:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(703899, 73890, 7743, '<td valign="top">The colours are nice and vibrant, however it''s hard to judge the focus and exposure due to the small size of the image.  It looks like there may be a few hot spots in the brighter areas.<br/> <br/>This subject may have worked well in a vertical (portrait) composition due to the vertical lines in the image.  It may have had more impact that way. 5</td>', 'The colours are nice and vibrant, however it''s hard to judge the focus and exposure due to the small size of the image.  It looks like there may be a few hot spots in the brighter areas. This subject may have worked well in a vertical (portrait) composition due to the vertical lines in the image.  It may have had more impact that way. 5', '2004-05-07 11:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(703931, 73765, 9581, '<td valign="top">I like title!!  I can see flames of fire in this!</td>', 'I like title!!  I can see flames of fire in this!', '2004-05-07 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(703935, 73852, 9581, '<td valign="top">Or a line of girls following Madeline, or a female Dpcer, (pigtails in the hair!)<br/></td>', 'Or a line of girls following Madeline, or a female Dpcer, (pigtails in the hair!)', '2004-05-07 11:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(703945, 73902, 9581, '<td valign="top">Im waiting for the marshans or aliens to come out ......neat!</td>', 'Im waiting for the marshans or aliens to come out ......neat!', '2004-05-07 11:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(703948, 73932, 9581, '<td valign="top">reminds me of a hotel vent in front of the window...</td>', 'reminds me of a hotel vent in front of the window...', '2004-05-07 11:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(703952, 73989, 15495, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2004-05-07 11:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(703956, 72503, 9581, '<td valign="top">wow! did you put a light in a shell? Its awesome!</td>', 'wow! did you put a light in a shell? Its awesome!', '2004-05-07 11:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(703957, 73776, 15495, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2004-05-07 11:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
