(703986, 73832, 9581, '<td valign="top">some neat lines! that dark hole  or spot in top kind of threw me off the good line angle towards light.</td>', 'some neat lines! that dark hole  or spot in top kind of threw me off the good line angle towards light.', '2004-05-07 12:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
