(704132, 73965, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-05-07 13:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(704176, 73943, 20673, '<td valign="top">I really llike this piece. Nice colors, good clarity, simple. Great work!</td>', 'I really llike this piece. Nice colors, good clarity, simple. Great work!', '2004-05-07 13:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(704344, 73657, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I love this.  I''m not sure what it is I like about it though.  I think it''s a combo of lighting and color.  Your detail is amazing with all the little scratches.  I have no clue what this is, but it is very interesting.  Wonderful find.  10</td>', 'Wow.  I love this.  I''m not sure what it is I like about it though.  I think it''s a combo of lighting and color.  Your detail is amazing with all the little scratches.  I have no clue what this is, but it is very interesting.  Wonderful find.  10', '2004-05-07 14:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(704356, 74006, 3080, '<td valign="top">The colors are alright, but there really isn''t anything that draws me in here.  I will admit that the large version looks better tha the thumbnail.  The thumbnail looks like you took a photo of something and really really screwed up the focus.  The larger version looks more like an abstract painting or something.  Really nice colors. ~Heather~</td>', 'The colors are alright, but there really isn''t anything that draws me in here.  I will admit that the large version looks better tha the thumbnail.  The thumbnail looks like you took a photo of something and really really screwed up the focus.  The larger version looks more like an abstract painting or something.  Really nice colors. ~Heather~', '2004-05-07 14:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
