(704464, 73924, 20324, '<td valign="top">A quilt.. how is this abstract?</td>', 'A quilt.. how is this abstract?', '2004-05-07 15:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(704469, 73877, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this effect at all.  It''s abstract, but not really my cup of tea.  you have reduced what was probably a nice flower shot to a 5 color mutation of something that could have looked nice.  I realize this was for an abstract shot, but this just looks mutalated.  the color isn''t even wow.  sorry it''s just not my thing.</td>', 'I don''t like this effect at all.  It''s abstract, but not really my cup of tea.  you have reduced what was probably a nice flower shot to a 5 color mutation of something that could have looked nice.  I realize this was for an abstract shot, but this just looks mutalated.  the color isn''t even wow.  sorry it''s just not my thing.', '2004-05-07 15:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(704472, 73927, 3080, '<td valign="top">interesting object.  I like it.  I think that the dof is perfect here and I like the background very much.  was the item placed on a sheet of glass?  very nice color and I like the orange/brown on blue.  The angle and placement of the object within the frame is great, and overall a very nice image.  congrats.</td>', 'interesting object.  I like it.  I think that the dof is perfect here and I like the background very much.  was the item placed on a sheet of glass?  very nice color and I like the orange/brown on blue.  The angle and placement of the object within the frame is great, and overall a very nice image.  congrats.', '2004-05-07 15:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(704481, 73936, 16004, '<td valign="top">I really don''t find myself responding to this image - the abstractiveness is a little bit too excessive really.  The very high levels of noise, especially on a monochromatic image, doesn''t work particularly well, or at least from my point of view.  I see lines, but shapes and colours are non-existent.  It would guess that the noise levels etc were done intentionally, and for the a salute you and your bravery.  I just don''t think it paid off.  sorry.</td>', 'I really don''t find myself responding to this image - the abstractiveness is a little bit too excessive really.  The very high levels of noise, especially on a monochromatic image, doesn''t work particularly well, or at least from my point of view.  I see lines, but shapes and colours are non-existent.  It would guess that the noise levels etc were done intentionally, and for the a salute you and your bravery.  I just don''t think it paid off.  sorry.', '2004-05-07 15:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(704520, 73966, 20754, '<td valign="top">A real eye-catcher!  Excellent use of form, color and negative space!</td>', 'A real eye-catcher!  Excellent use of form, color and negative space!', '2004-05-07 16:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(704528, 73475, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot overall, but a bit overexposed at the tip, and its basically a flower macro first, and thus does not give the feel of an abstract.  The forms are there, but this is a good example of why things that are too recognizable are not perceived as abstract.</td>', 'Nice shot overall, but a bit overexposed at the tip, and its basically a flower macro first, and thus does not give the feel of an abstract.  The forms are there, but this is a good example of why things that are too recognizable are not perceived as abstract.', '2004-05-07 16:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(704532, 73943, 12253, '<td valign="top">crisp shot, nice abstraction, good colors.</td>', 'crisp shot, nice abstraction, good colors.', '2004-05-07 16:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(704537, 73529, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is one of the creepiest shots i''ve ever seen on this site.  is it really a dead evil fish about to attack your lens, or is it a trick my eyes are playing?  There really does seem to be a lot going on here - i especially like the reds and greens reflected (?) in the water...  and the bubbles give some intensity with what''s going on.  I have no idea WHAT is going on, but it certainly is going on with ghusto.  I''m a bit too disturbed and grossed out to give you a very high score, but it''s a good picture all the same.</td>', 'This is one of the creepiest shots i''ve ever seen on this site.  is it really a dead evil fish about to attack your lens, or is it a trick my eyes are playing?  There really does seem to be a lot going on here - i especially like the reds and greens reflected (?) in the water...  and the bubbles give some intensity with what''s going on.  I have no idea WHAT is going on, but it certainly is going on with ghusto.  I''m a bit too disturbed and grossed out to give you a very high score, but it''s a good picture all the same.', '2004-05-07 16:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(704542, 73966, 16004, '<td valign="top">It''s very pretty.   The cropping looks a little bit out, gigving the impression that it''s tightly squeezed in the corner and doesn''t feel that natural.  i think it would look less out if either you a) zoomed out and pulled the thing towards the centre a bit (but increasing the quantity of black to the right and bottom, or b) zoomed in a bit and have the top and the left of the orange thing outside the boundary of the image.  Actually, the item in question is so lovely, it could have filled the image - have you tried a macro shot of it, in the way you have it illuminated?  Lighting BTW, is brilliant.  Is it an ashtray with a light source underneath it?  very nice.  7.</td>', 'It''s very pretty.   The cropping looks a little bit out, gigving the impression that it''s tightly squeezed in the corner and doesn''t feel that natural.  i think it would look less out if either you a) zoomed out and pulled the thing towards the centre a bit (but increasing the quantity of black to the right and bottom, or b) zoomed in a bit and have the top and the left of the orange thing outside the boundary of the image.  Actually, the item in question is so lovely, it could have filled the image - have you tried a macro shot of it, in the way you have it illuminated?  Lighting BTW, is brilliant.  Is it an ashtray with a light source underneath it?  very nice.  7.', '2004-05-07 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(704545, 73929, 16004, '<td valign="top">I have given this a 9.  This is the thing abstract should be, and i''m quite envious that you have a good eye for colour and shapes.  The red is beautiful - so very bold.  I only didn''t give it full marks because i found the white border to the purple and yellow sheets of paper a bit distracting - it''s not nearly as apparent on the left between the blue and the turquoise, though.  Composition is great.</td>', 'I have given this a 9.  This is the thing abstract should be, and i''m quite envious that you have a good eye for colour and shapes.  The red is beautiful - so very bold.  I only didn''t give it full marks because i found the white border to the purple and yellow sheets of paper a bit distracting - it''s not nearly as apparent on the left between the blue and the turquoise, though.  Composition is great.', '2004-05-07 16:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(704560, 73937, 15495, '<td valign="top">Where is the green?</td>', 'Where is the green?', '2004-05-07 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
