(704892, 73872, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very similiar to another Slinky shot here; both executions absolutely stunning. Since I am one of the ones who don''t think abstract has to be unrecognizable, I gave this a very high score. Lighting is great also.</td>', 'Very similiar to another Slinky shot here; both executions absolutely stunning. Since I am one of the ones who don''t think abstract has to be unrecognizable, I gave this a very high score. Lighting is great also.', '2004-05-07 21:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
