(704900, 73411, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very unusual. Like many of my favorites, it is recognizable, but is more about form and color -- so I scored it very high. The bubbles are so crisp, the edges have just the right amount of softness/hardness, and the clean white background with just a hint of shadow and movement. How did you come up with this one??</td>', 'Very unusual. Like many of my favorites, it is recognizable, but is more about form and color -- so I scored it very high. The bubbles are so crisp, the edges have just the right amount of softness/hardness, and the clean white background with just a hint of shadow and movement. How did you come up with this one??', '2004-05-07 21:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(704904, 73452, 20779, '<td valign="top">This could also win in a Simplicity challenge! Almost space age in its feel, also. I love this one. The ring is like an unachored halo. 8 at least. I hope you tell us how you caught this one.</td>', 'This could also win in a Simplicity challenge! Almost space age in its feel, also. I love this one. The ring is like an unachored halo. 8 at least. I hope you tell us how you caught this one.', '2004-05-07 21:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
