(706667, 73818, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is great except for the distractions from the lines in the form of small white blotches on the blue portions of the image which could have easily been cloned away.</td>', 'This is great except for the distractions from the lines in the form of small white blotches on the blue portions of the image which could have easily been cloned away.', '2004-05-09 09:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(706670, 73162, 8891, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but the great compostion, shapes and colors override that for me. Excellent.</td>', 'A little dark, but the great compostion, shapes and colors override that for me. Excellent.', '2004-05-09 09:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(706671, 73929, 8891, '<td valign="top">LOSE THE FRAME....you have enough clash without it....WOW WHAT A BAD COLOR OF THE FRAME(and that don''t necessarily mean just the green!)....everything else is GREAT!</td>', 'LOSE THE FRAME....you have enough clash without it....WOW WHAT A BAD COLOR OF THE FRAME(and that don''t necessarily mean just the green!)....everything else is GREAT!', '2004-05-09 09:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(706751, 73991, 21527, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Photo!!</td>', 'Fantastic Photo!!', '2004-05-09 11:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(706886, 73927, 7560, '<td valign="top">Interesting object, one that keeps me coming back to look. I like the color contrast.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Interesting object, one that keeps me coming back to look. I like the color contrast. 8', '2004-05-09 12:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(706915, 73652, 4767, '<td valign="top">I love reflections on wavy water.  Well captured, well seen!</td>', 'I love reflections on wavy water.  Well captured, well seen!', '2004-05-09 12:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(706917, 73349, 4767, '<td valign="top">YEAH!   A NON-obvious abstract that isn''t out of focus or totally random!  I like the depth of field control; the color shift is awesome.. I like this a LOT!</td>', 'YEAH!   A NON-obvious abstract that isn''t out of focus or totally random!  I like the depth of field control; the color shift is awesome.. I like this a LOT!', '2004-05-09 12:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(706923, 73821, 4767, '<td valign="top">_I_ like it!  Composition, color, clarity is escellent!  Bummer about the white line at the perigee of the building there.  Oversharpened or just digital artifacts... they distract  what is otherwise a flawless (imho) image.</td>', '_I_ like it!  Composition, color, clarity is escellent!  Bummer about the white line at the perigee of the building there.  Oversharpened or just digital artifacts... they distract  what is otherwise a flawless (imho) image.', '2004-05-09 12:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(706929, 73386, 4767, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Why does the word ''rust'' sound so familiar?  OH!  I remember!  The OTHER challenge!  (Is this an outtake from the other? Or were there so many great rust images you couldn''t decide?)<br/> <br/>Good image.  Nicely abstract.  Wish your title were a little more abstract, but it''s hard to come up with creative titles, I realise.  Good luck with this. 7</td>', 'Hmmm. Why does the word ''rust'' sound so familiar?  OH!  I remember!  The OTHER challenge!  (Is this an outtake from the other? Or were there so many great rust images you couldn''t decide?) Good image.  Nicely abstract.  Wish your title were a little more abstract, but it''s hard to come up with creative titles, I realise.  Good luck with this. 7', '2004-05-09 13:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(706933, 73631, 4767, '<td valign="top">Not the most creative submission in the challenge.  If it were so small one couldn''t see the dots, perhaps it would be more appealing, but it looks like one is standing too close to a TV screen.</td>', 'Not the most creative submission in the challenge.  If it were so small one couldn''t see the dots, perhaps it would be more appealing, but it looks like one is standing too close to a TV screen.', '2004-05-09 13:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(706934, 73832, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice light play!  9</td>', 'Nice light play!  9', '2004-05-09 13:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(706943, 73888, 4767, '<td valign="top">This surprised me.  Thumbnail didn''t hint at how much I''d like this image, but it has a subtle power to draw the eye.  Feels very Manet somehow.  10</td>', 'This surprised me.  Thumbnail didn''t hint at how much I''d like this image, but it has a subtle power to draw the eye.  Feels very Manet somehow.  10', '2004-05-09 13:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(706945, 73364, 4767, '<td valign="top">quelquechose aussi, je pense.  interessant!</td>', 'quelquechose aussi, je pense.  interessant!', '2004-05-09 13:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(706959, 73396, 12962, '<td valign="top">Great perspective ... a little bit overexposed at the top but if that''s the part of the composition, then you were successful in your implementation of your vision.  Good job!</td>', 'Great perspective ... a little bit overexposed at the top but if that''s the part of the composition, then you were successful in your implementation of your vision.  Good job!', '2004-05-09 13:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(706960, 74002, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, beautivul composition and certainly very abstract.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, beautivul composition and certainly very abstract.', '2004-05-09 13:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(706962, 73162, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is great!  It certainly fits the challenge, but more than that, it is quite a good representation of abstract paintings that came out in the 50s and 60s.  The colors are wild, the angles and lines arranged in seemingly ordered chaos and repetition works well.  The diagonals make this appealing to many appreciative eyes.</td>', 'This is great!  It certainly fits the challenge, but more than that, it is quite a good representation of abstract paintings that came out in the 50s and 60s.  The colors are wild, the angles and lines arranged in seemingly ordered chaos and repetition works well.  The diagonals make this appealing to many appreciative eyes.', '2004-05-09 13:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(707198, 73794, 18349, '<td valign="top">I can tell what this is.</td>', 'I can tell what this is.', '2004-05-09 16:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(707206, 73619, 4517, '<td valign="top">I like this, dunno why but i do.</td>', 'I like this, dunno why but i do.', '2004-05-09 17:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(707210, 73832, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of light both direct and reflective. I like the texture on the wall, too. Might have looked better as b/w.</td>', 'Interesting use of light both direct and reflective. I like the texture on the wall, too. Might have looked better as b/w.', '2004-05-09 17:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(707214, 73747, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space. The background matches the foreground well. Not sure what this is but I like it.  :) 8</td>', 'Good use of negative space. The background matches the foreground well. Not sure what this is but I like it.  :) 8', '2004-05-09 17:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(707218, 73364, 8054, '<td valign="top">The bands of color look artificial and pixelated. Bottom edge is a little distracting and should have been cropped a bit more. Interersting lighting effects, however.</td>', 'The bands of color look artificial and pixelated. Bottom edge is a little distracting and should have been cropped a bit more. Interersting lighting effects, however.', '2004-05-09 17:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(707224, 73798, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of CDs! I''ve always liked the way light is broken down in the polycarbonate. Surface is a smidgen dusty but good image overall. 7</td>', 'Very interesting use of CDs! I''ve always liked the way light is broken down in the polycarbonate. Surface is a smidgen dusty but good image overall. 7', '2004-05-09 17:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(707226, 72618, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject but the I-beams are out of focus.</td>', 'Excellent subject but the I-beams are out of focus.', '2004-05-09 17:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(707230, 73980, 8054, '<td valign="top">Creative title and it fits perfectly. Maybe a bit of adjustment to levels and color balance might help especially the greens since the look a bit on the pale side.</td>', 'Creative title and it fits perfectly. Maybe a bit of adjustment to levels and color balance might help especially the greens since the look a bit on the pale side.', '2004-05-09 17:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(707232, 73890, 8054, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2004-05-09 17:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(707234, 73821, 8054, '<td valign="top">Creative perspective and good use of negative space. Looks like something I''d see if I was lying down on a lawn and looking up at a building. 7</td>', 'Creative perspective and good use of negative space. Looks like something I''d see if I was lying down on a lawn and looking up at a building. 7', '2004-05-09 17:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(707236, 73931, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good job of placing the picture 90º CCW. Certainly a new twist from the norm. 7</td>', 'Good job of placing the picture 90º CCW. Certainly a new twist from the norm. 7', '2004-05-09 17:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(707239, 73513, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very emotive image in b/w! Too bad the sky is not as exciting as the concrete structure. 9!</td>', 'Very emotive image in b/w! Too bad the sky is not as exciting as the concrete structure. 9!', '2004-05-09 17:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(707344, 73978, 3080, '<td valign="top">The different blues are nice, but the image doesn''t really appeal to me.  I think for the most part it fits the abstract category, but I don''t like the effect used to create the image.  I guess I was thinking more along the lines of TAKE an abstract image, not take a regular image and distort it so much it becomes abstract.  I guess in the end it''s all the same, but I''d prefer this without the effect. ~Heather~</td>', 'The different blues are nice, but the image doesn''t really appeal to me.  I think for the most part it fits the abstract category, but I don''t like the effect used to create the image.  I guess I was thinking more along the lines of TAKE an abstract image, not take a regular image and distort it so much it becomes abstract.  I guess in the end it''s all the same, but I''d prefer this without the effect. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 19:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(707345, 74007, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is good.  I wonder how this would work with a solid background though.  I see that it''s another one of these things that is in the background, and it works alright, but would like to see it with a simple, plain, one colored background.  Your dof is alright and focus is good on the spikey things.  color is nice and placement of the main subject is nice as well.  Overall, nice abstract. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think the lighting is good.  I wonder how this would work with a solid background though.  I see that it''s another one of these things that is in the background, and it works alright, but would like to see it with a simple, plain, one colored background.  Your dof is alright and focus is good on the spikey things.  color is nice and placement of the main subject is nice as well.  Overall, nice abstract. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 19:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(707348, 73190, 3080, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail doesn''t do this justice at all.  The thumb looks like a horribly distorted flower image, of which I''ve seen enough of so far.  The large image here really shines.  whatever it is, I like the little circular patterns and the colors are nice.  This is pleasing to look at.  Different, nice color, and definately abstract.  Nice job. ~Heather~</td>', 'The thumbnail doesn''t do this justice at all.  The thumb looks like a horribly distorted flower image, of which I''ve seen enough of so far.  The large image here really shines.  whatever it is, I like the little circular patterns and the colors are nice.  This is pleasing to look at.  Different, nice color, and definately abstract.  Nice job. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 19:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(707349, 73977, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice color, lighting and focus.  DOF is very nice, as is the angle at which you took the photo, and placement of the subject.  Details are very nice.  I like that there are textured little patterns on the ridges, and the slight shadows really add here.  Nice job. ~Heather~</td>', 'Nice color, lighting and focus.  DOF is very nice, as is the angle at which you took the photo, and placement of the subject.  Details are very nice.  I like that there are textured little patterns on the ridges, and the slight shadows really add here.  Nice job. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(707351, 73452, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Don''t know what it is, but the photo is very nicely taken, and interesting to look at as well.  Great focus and clarity.  The angle at which you took the photo is nice, and the placement of the subject (whatever it is) is nice as well.  Overall a very pleasing image and definately abstract.  I just say good job, and I expect this to be up there near the top somewhere.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I like it.  Don''t know what it is, but the photo is very nicely taken, and interesting to look at as well.  Great focus and clarity.  The angle at which you took the photo is nice, and the placement of the subject (whatever it is) is nice as well.  Overall a very pleasing image and definately abstract.  I just say good job, and I expect this to be up there near the top somewhere.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(707353, 73848, 3080, '<td valign="top">while I picture this to be a 3d object, the image seems very flat.  I see where texture should be, but as I said, very flat.  not sure how you could bring this out more.  maybe side lighting?  colors are interesting, althought maybe slightly dark.  Focus and clarity are really good.  nothing blurred that shouldn''t be in my opinion.  Overall definately abstract, just wish it had more depth. ~Heather~</td>', 'while I picture this to be a 3d object, the image seems very flat.  I see where texture should be, but as I said, very flat.  not sure how you could bring this out more.  maybe side lighting?  colors are interesting, althought maybe slightly dark.  Focus and clarity are really good.  nothing blurred that shouldn''t be in my opinion.  Overall definately abstract, just wish it had more depth. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(707355, 72898, 3080, '<td valign="top">abstract doesn''t have to mean blurred beyond recognition.  I think this is inappropriate blurring here.  Had this been in focus, I think it would have been more appealing to me.  I like the color, and the waves coming from the object are ok, the crop is different, and lighting appears to be fine, I just wish i could SEE this better. ~Heather~</td>', 'abstract doesn''t have to mean blurred beyond recognition.  I think this is inappropriate blurring here.  Had this been in focus, I think it would have been more appealing to me.  I like the color, and the waves coming from the object are ok, the crop is different, and lighting appears to be fine, I just wish i could SEE this better. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(707357, 72557, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like water on a window or glass of some sort.  I wonder how this would work with something interesting on the other side of the glass. (if in fact this is what it is)  Say something with bright colors, or an interesting pattern or something.  Right now, I just see a dark ''stick'' that runs through the dead center of the image.  Maybe if you couldn''t get something interesting on the other side, at least move the dark thing to one side or another.  maybe make it diagonal or something.  Seems dull as is.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Looks like water on a window or glass of some sort.  I wonder how this would work with something interesting on the other side of the glass. (if in fact this is what it is)  Say something with bright colors, or an interesting pattern or something.  Right now, I just see a dark ''stick'' that runs through the dead center of the image.  Maybe if you couldn''t get something interesting on the other side, at least move the dark thing to one side or another.  maybe make it diagonal or something.  Seems dull as is.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(707358, 73228, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not a clue what this is, so definately abstract.  I tried a crop without the green part, and that looked pretty neat too.  Just the blue and white.  I think your focus is good for this shot, and the colors definatley punch.  Lighting seems alright.  Overall pleasing to look at so I say good job. ~Heather~</td>', 'Not a clue what this is, so definately abstract.  I tried a crop without the green part, and that looked pretty neat too.  Just the blue and white.  I think your focus is good for this shot, and the colors definatley punch.  Lighting seems alright.  Overall pleasing to look at so I say good job. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(707359, 73929, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like the picture! I think you captured what abstract is about but I think the green border just takes away from this other wise perfect pic.</td>', 'I like the picture! I think you captured what abstract is about but I think the green border just takes away from this other wise perfect pic.', '2004-05-09 20:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(707363, 73931, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like a photo taken out of an airplane that was turned on it''s side.  It does look pretty abstract, but I would have guessed that on the first look.  Maybe I''m wrong, who knows.  Anyway, definately abstract.  I wish the colors were a bit brighter.  the seems muted a bit.  Otherwise, it''s interesting to look at.  I like the 3d look of it.  definately has depth. ~Heather~</td>', 'Looks like a photo taken out of an airplane that was turned on it''s side.  It does look pretty abstract, but I would have guessed that on the first look.  Maybe I''m wrong, who knows.  Anyway, definately abstract.  I wish the colors were a bit brighter.  the seems muted a bit.  Otherwise, it''s interesting to look at.  I like the 3d look of it.  definately has depth. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(707367, 73818, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks like a couple things to me.  First, it looks like that building that (I can''t remember his name) keeps winnind ribbons with.  And it also looks like stairs to a swimming pool.  I like the colors, and the shadows are a nice touch in this shot.  The texture of the blue though makes the shot look grainy.  Nice focus and the angle and framing are good as well.  Definately abstract looking. ~Heather~</td>', 'This looks like a couple things to me.  First, it looks like that building that (I can''t remember his name) keeps winnind ribbons with.  And it also looks like stairs to a swimming pool.  I like the colors, and the shadows are a nice touch in this shot.  The texture of the blue though makes the shot look grainy.  Nice focus and the angle and framing are good as well.  Definately abstract looking. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(707369, 73764, 3080, '<td valign="top">HA! it''s a lava lamp.  lol.  I stared at this wondering what the heck it was, and then it hit me all at once. duh.  Definately abstract with a twist.  the color is great, and the lighting is what makes this photo.  great abstract.  really draws me in to look closer and your focus and clarity are really good as well.  very nice.  ~Heather~</td>', 'HA! it''s a lava lamp.  lol.  I stared at this wondering what the heck it was, and then it hit me all at once. duh.  Definately abstract with a twist.  the color is great, and the lighting is what makes this photo.  great abstract.  really draws me in to look closer and your focus and clarity are really good as well.  very nice.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(707371, 72864, 3080, '<td valign="top">well...it''s abstract.  the one thing that stands out to me greatly here is the blobby star near the center of the photo on the right side.  kind of looks like 6 stars mooshed together right there.  kind of draws a lot of attention.  The blues are interesting, with a small hint of red in there occationally.  It doesnt really hold my attention though, don''t think it draws me in and keeps me there.  ~Heather~</td>', 'well...it''s abstract.  the one thing that stands out to me greatly here is the blobby star near the center of the photo on the right side.  kind of looks like 6 stars mooshed together right there.  kind of draws a lot of attention.  The blues are interesting, with a small hint of red in there occationally.  It doesnt really hold my attention though, don''t think it draws me in and keeps me there.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(707376, 73841, 13772, '<td valign="top">Grilled Cheese. Do I win!?! Nice picture by the way.</td>', 'Grilled Cheese. Do I win!?! Nice picture by the way.', '2004-05-09 20:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(707380, 73768, 3080, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting.  The angle and framing/cropping is great.  I like how you have placed your subject withing the frame.  The diagonals are very nice.  the one thing that stands out to me as very odd is that this seems to be a black and white image, however, there is color (reddish) in the bottom left corner.  That small spot of color really draws me attention down to that corner, and kind of creates a distraction.  Otherwise, nice abstract. ~Heather~</td>', 'Love the lighting.  The angle and framing/cropping is great.  I like how you have placed your subject withing the frame.  The diagonals are very nice.  the one thing that stands out to me as very odd is that this seems to be a black and white image, however, there is color (reddish) in the bottom left corner.  That small spot of color really draws me attention down to that corner, and kind of creates a distraction.  Otherwise, nice abstract. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(707383, 73925, 3080, '<td valign="top">Except green isn''t primary.  Oh well, doesn''t matter.  I like this all except the funny texture on the yellow marble, and the fact that the yellow marble is almost all green.  I would prefer if it were yellow more, that would balance it out a bit in my opinion.  I do like the set up though.  Another rare interesting abstract among the many colored blobs. ~Heather~</td>', 'Except green isn''t primary.  Oh well, doesn''t matter.  I like this all except the funny texture on the yellow marble, and the fact that the yellow marble is almost all green.  I would prefer if it were yellow more, that would balance it out a bit in my opinion.  I do like the set up though.  Another rare interesting abstract among the many colored blobs. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(707387, 73937, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think that a little more DOF wouldn''t hurt.  Right now, there is very little to look at.  I think it''s an alright abstract for the challenge, but it''s not really drawing my interest much at all.  I wish somehow that the colors stood out a bit more.  Maybe it''s the lighting?  the angle is alright.  Any more from the top, and it would be boring, and any more from the side would be just flat.  this does have depth. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think that a little more DOF wouldn''t hurt.  Right now, there is very little to look at.  I think it''s an alright abstract for the challenge, but it''s not really drawing my interest much at all.  I wish somehow that the colors stood out a bit more.  Maybe it''s the lighting?  the angle is alright.  Any more from the top, and it would be boring, and any more from the side would be just flat.  this does have depth. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(707395, 73624, 3080, '<td valign="top">a red saturated napkin on a lenolium floor?  Not quite sure about abstract, but I do think it''s a great image.  I love how you have placed the square on the floor within the frame.  very nice placement there.  the red really stands out, and while normally, a bloody looking napkin on the floor wouldn''t be exciting, you have taken it in a interesting way.  2 things that stand out to me are the shadows.  I kind of find them distracting, and there seems to be a solid object under the napkin, either that, or that section of napkin has shadow on it too, making that section look strange.  I think  you did a mostly good job with this photo.  ~Heather~</td>', 'a red saturated napkin on a lenolium floor?  Not quite sure about abstract, but I do think it''s a great image.  I love how you have placed the square on the floor within the frame.  very nice placement there.  the red really stands out, and while normally, a bloody looking napkin on the floor wouldn''t be exciting, you have taken it in a interesting way.  2 things that stand out to me are the shadows.  I kind of find them distracting, and there seems to be a solid object under the napkin, either that, or that section of napkin has shadow on it too, making that section look strange.  I think  you did a mostly good job with this photo.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(707427, 73328, 8891, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, particularly in the drop....I would have taken out, pre shot the front most vertical item, other than that, this is very interesting and very well done....The drop is great!</td>', 'Excellent detail, particularly in the drop....I would have taken out, pre shot the front most vertical item, other than that, this is very interesting and very well done....The drop is great!', '2004-05-09 21:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(707432, 73712, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great, like the colors and the shadows (wish there were more) and the compositon, the excellent lighting.  Very very well done.</td>', 'Great, like the colors and the shadows (wish there were more) and the compositon, the excellent lighting.  Very very well done.', '2004-05-09 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(707439, 73980, 8891, '<td valign="top">A fine macro...I think you could have got the  great trio together and closer and recomposed with no distraction of the right background it would have been better, but this is a great a idea and fine entry for this challenge.</td>', 'A fine macro...I think you could have got the  great trio together and closer and recomposed with no distraction of the right background it would have been better, but this is a great a idea and fine entry for this challenge.', '2004-05-09 21:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(707443, 73612, 8891, '<td valign="top">Although I am not usually a fan of centering I think it works well ins this.  Like it very much, especially the contrasts of the patterns on the perimeter against that of the center.  Like the duotone look it has as sell and the fine detail.  Excellent.</td>', 'Although I am not usually a fan of centering I think it works well ins this.  Like it very much, especially the contrasts of the patterns on the perimeter against that of the center.  Like the duotone look it has as sell and the fine detail.  Excellent.', '2004-05-09 21:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
