(707468, 73513, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I''ve only said that a few times this challenge, so I really hope this places up there in the top few.  Anyway, I love the diagonal, the half and half is really nice.  I like the abstractness, and the background is great, nothing distracting there.  The detail is still there, even though it be abstract.  Very nice placement of the subject and the cropping/framing is beautiful.  Perfect 10 from me. ~Heather~</td>', 'I love it.  I''ve only said that a few times this challenge, so I really hope this places up there in the top few.  Anyway, I love the diagonal, the half and half is really nice.  I like the abstractness, and the background is great, nothing distracting there.  The detail is still there, even though it be abstract.  Very nice placement of the subject and the cropping/framing is beautiful.  Perfect 10 from me. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 21:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(707471, 72493, 8891, '<td valign="top">of the several flora abstracts in this challenge, this is my favorite.  The Green color is rich and wonderful.  The lines are not shown in super macro and make the image a great abstract.  Well done.</td>', 'of the several flora abstracts in this challenge, this is my favorite.  The Green color is rich and wonderful.  The lines are not shown in super macro and make the image a great abstract.  Well done.', '2004-05-09 21:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(707473, 73851, 3080, '<td valign="top">From the challenge description. "If it is recognizable as an object - it is not an abstract"  I can recognize this as an object, therfor to me, it''s a little slow on meeting the challenge, however, it is a great photo non the less.  Excellent focus and clarity and lighting is good. I like how it fills the entire photo and the patterns are nice.  Overall a very nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'From the challenge description. "If it is recognizable as an object - it is not an abstract"  I can recognize this as an object, therfor to me, it''s a little slow on meeting the challenge, however, it is a great photo non the less.  Excellent focus and clarity and lighting is good. I like how it fills the entire photo and the patterns are nice.  Overall a very nice shot. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 21:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(707474, 72844, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I like the splash of color, and the angle and framing/cropping are great as well.  nice line placement and I like the diagonals.  Not really much else to say.  focus and clarity are really nice and I think that the lighting was in your favor.  really good.  i hope to see this up near the top this challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is very nice.  I like the splash of color, and the angle and framing/cropping are great as well.  nice line placement and I like the diagonals.  Not really much else to say.  focus and clarity are really nice and I think that the lighting was in your favor.  really good.  i hope to see this up near the top this challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 21:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(707476, 73988, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is perfect in my opinion.  I hope to see this on the main page come midnight tonight.  VERY sharp looking.  I like the abstractness.  it really gives me a feel of depth, I like the black and whiteness.  The lit ridge is wonderfully splitting the image in a very interesting way.  I like how it''s plain on one side, and then has that ball thing on the other.  Definately abstract, and definately my favorite this challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This is perfect in my opinion.  I hope to see this on the main page come midnight tonight.  VERY sharp looking.  I like the abstractness.  it really gives me a feel of depth, I like the black and whiteness.  The lit ridge is wonderfully splitting the image in a very interesting way.  I like how it''s plain on one side, and then has that ball thing on the other.  Definately abstract, and definately my favorite this challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 21:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(707478, 73612, 3080, '<td valign="top">I clicked on the thumbnail, cause it wasn''t interesting and I was gonna offer my opinion, however, when I clicked on the thumb, up popped this, which is actually full of interesting shapes and patterns.  Nice focus, I like the lines behind the bubbles, and I like the pattern of the glass around the edges.  Very nice abstract. ~Heather~</td>', 'I clicked on the thumbnail, cause it wasn''t interesting and I was gonna offer my opinion, however, when I clicked on the thumb, up popped this, which is actually full of interesting shapes and patterns.  Nice focus, I like the lines behind the bubbles, and I like the pattern of the glass around the edges.  Very nice abstract. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 21:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(707555, 73512, 12311, '<td valign="top">Since I have no idea what this is, it meets the challenge 100%.  It''s sharp, colorful, and makes me wonder..., plus, I just plain like it.  8</td>', 'Since I have no idea what this is, it meets the challenge 100%.  It''s sharp, colorful, and makes me wonder..., plus, I just plain like it.  8', '2004-05-09 22:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
