(707723, 72435, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern and the black and white alot, but I wish it wasn''t so soft a focus. Nice picture though!</td>', 'I like the pattern and the black and white alot, but I wish it wasn''t so soft a focus. Nice picture though!', '2004-05-09 23:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(707726, 72801, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the glossy sharpness and the color very much, but the composition feels a little awkward to me. The lines draw your eye out of the photo instead of keeping you focused in it.</td>', 'I like the glossy sharpness and the color very much, but the composition feels a little awkward to me. The lines draw your eye out of the photo instead of keeping you focused in it.', '2004-05-09 23:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(707728, 73977, 20395, '<td valign="top">Very nice line and color. I might have cleaned up the waterspots though!</td>', 'Very nice line and color. I might have cleaned up the waterspots though!', '2004-05-09 23:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(707733, 73712, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and compostion a lot. It gets a little muddy on the lower left hand side, and that stack of objects competes for focus with the much more interesting intersection of objects in the center. Maybe just a tad tighter crop on the left?</td>', 'I like the colors and compostion a lot. It gets a little muddy on the lower left hand side, and that stack of objects competes for focus with the much more interesting intersection of objects in the center. Maybe just a tad tighter crop on the left?', '2004-05-09 23:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(707740, 73924, 3080, '<td valign="top">The challenge states that if you can identify it as an object, then it''s not an abstract.  I can clearly identify this, so I''m not really sure it meets the challenges idea of abstract, however, I do believe it is well done.  The texture and detail are both good.  Focus and clarity are excellent.  And there is nothing distracting with the lighting.  Overall really nice shot, just maybe not abstract enough for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'The challenge states that if you can identify it as an object, then it''s not an abstract.  I can clearly identify this, so I''m not really sure it meets the challenges idea of abstract, however, I do believe it is well done.  The texture and detail are both good.  Focus and clarity are excellent.  And there is nothing distracting with the lighting.  Overall really nice shot, just maybe not abstract enough for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 23:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(707742, 73852, 3080, '<td valign="top">The challenge states that if you can identify it as an object, then it''s not an abstract.  I can clearly identify this, so I''m not really sure it meets the challenges idea of abstract, however, I do think it''s a nice photo of these little flowers.  I believe they are called Bleeding Hearts.  The lighting gets a little harsh toward the top of the photo near the upper right.  But focus and clarity are ok, and the DOF is nice as well.  I like know you have these diagonally placed.  Overall good. ~Heather~</td>', 'The challenge states that if you can identify it as an object, then it''s not an abstract.  I can clearly identify this, so I''m not really sure it meets the challenges idea of abstract, however, I do think it''s a nice photo of these little flowers.  I believe they are called Bleeding Hearts.  The lighting gets a little harsh toward the top of the photo near the upper right.  But focus and clarity are ok, and the DOF is nice as well.  I like know you have these diagonally placed.  Overall good. ~Heather~', '2004-05-09 23:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
