(707858, 73912, 16703, '<td valign="top">congradtulations heida... it deserved to be in top 10 but this is not bad at all i think.. great image</td>', 'congradtulations heida... it deserved to be in top 10 but this is not bad at all i think.. great image', '2004-05-10 01:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(707861, 73996, 15511, '<td valign="top">So, I submit a photo with an abstact idea, instead of an abstract <br/>image. What do I know? It''s Sunday. I wanna do something. <br/> <br/>I shoot the image. Get home. Prepare to upload. Resize for web, <br/>decided it needed no editing. Thought I might apply some kinda filter, <br/>...nah.<br/> <br/>Ponder titles. Submit.<br/> <br/>Ooh, the cruelty. Shoulda thought of a different title. Shoulda <br/>blurred some of it. Shoulda made "an honest attempt" (according to <br/>one critic).<br/> <br/>All I can think is (from the bottom):<br/> <br/>It''s not; <br/>no s**t!; <br/>agreed; <br/>...duh...; <br/>thank you!; <br/>thanks, and I now realize that; <br/>you don''t have your own opinion?; <br/>agreed; <br/>Thanks, I thought that, too, but AFTER I submitted it!; <br/>Well, I wasn''t trying a DIS-honest attempt; <br/>Thanks for your objectivity. I''m trying to learn.<br/>Thank you.<br/> <br/>You know, I don''t need a camera. I can do this with pencil and <br/>paper. Cameras are faster, and I''m realizing that there are only so <br/>many hours left in my life.<br/> <br/>What I''m really searching for is that "artistic eye"; that certain <br/>something that says to to me, "ART!" That''s why I''m here. There are <br/>so many great examples at DPC, that, (Thank God for cable internet) I''ll never run out of ideas to look for... if I only had some creativity!<br/> <br/>Of course, I won''t quit. This is too much fun.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-23 10:49:12.</i></td>', 'So, I submit a photo with an abstact idea, instead of an abstract image. What do I know? It''s Sunday. I wanna do something.  I shoot the image. Get home. Prepare to upload. Resize for web, decided it needed no editing. Thought I might apply some kinda filter, ...nah. Ponder titles. Submit. Ooh, the cruelty. Shoulda thought of a different title. Shoulda blurred some of it. Shoulda made "an honest attempt" (according to one critic). All I can think is (from the bottom): It''s not; no s**t!; agreed; ...duh...; thank you!; thanks, and I now realize that; you don''t have your own opinion?; agreed; Thanks, I thought that, too, but AFTER I submitted it!; Well, I wasn''t trying a DIS-honest attempt; Thanks for your objectivity. I''m trying to learn.Thank you. You know, I don''t need a camera. I can do this with pencil and paper. Cameras are faster, and I''m realizing that there are only so many hours left in my life. What I''m really searching for is that "artistic eye"; that certain something that says to to me, "ART!" That''s why I''m here. There are so many great examples at DPC, that, (Thank God for cable internet) I''ll never run out of ideas to look for... if I only had some creativity! Of course, I won''t quit. This is too much fun.', '2004-05-10 01:03:11.000000', '2005-06-23 11:49:12.000000', 0),
(707863, 73747, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Jean! Congrats. :-)</td>', 'Wonderful Jean! Congrats. :-)', '2004-05-10 01:05:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(707864, 73411, 9763, '<td valign="top">Thank you to those who have voted and commented.  I really wish I had taken the tiny brown piece of potpourri out of the photo, but alas, too late now!  I loved this challenge.  The photos are beautiful!</td>', 'Thank you to those who have voted and commented.  I really wish I had taken the tiny brown piece of potpourri out of the photo, but alas, too late now!  I loved this challenge.  The photos are beautiful!', '2004-05-10 01:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(707865, 73328, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job!  Very abstract..:-) Congrats!!!</td>', 'Good job!  Very abstract..:-) Congrats!!!', '2004-05-10 01:06:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(707867, 73747, 5112, '<td valign="top">Jean, CONGRATULATIONS!!!!  You''re back in form :)  Good work!<br/> <br/>Added:  but ... what is it?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-10 00:08:13.</i></td>', 'Jean, CONGRATULATIONS!!!!  You''re back in form :)  Good work! Added:  but ... what is it?', '2004-05-10 01:07:32.000000', '2004-05-10 01:08:13.000000', 0),
(707868, 72654, 16148, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and great scores.  My highest rated photograph yet! There were several excellent abstracts in this challenge and I was so close to my first ribbon.  This shell is beautiful but kind of boring for a photograph.  At least this was my initial impression before back lighting and looking closer.  I was pleasantly surprised by what I discovered.  This image turned out better than I expected with only minor editing in Photoshop Elements.  I''m glad you enjoyed it.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and great scores.  My highest rated photograph yet! There were several excellent abstracts in this challenge and I was so close to my first ribbon.  This shell is beautiful but kind of boring for a photograph.  At least this was my initial impression before back lighting and looking closer.  I was pleasantly surprised by what I discovered.  This image turned out better than I expected with only minor editing in Photoshop Elements.  I''m glad you enjoyed it.', '2004-05-10 01:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(707870, 73747, 11181, '<td valign="top">Well done! Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Well done! Congrats on the ribbon!', '2004-05-10 01:10:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(707871, 73328, 11181, '<td valign="top">Excellent work! Well deserved ribbon! Congrats!</td>', 'Excellent work! Well deserved ribbon! Congrats!', '2004-05-10 01:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(707875, 73862, 11843, '<td valign="top">I had this pegged for 1st or 2nd! You were robbed!!! Love it! Cheers....Martin</td>', 'I had this pegged for 1st or 2nd! You were robbed!!! Love it! Cheers....Martin', '2004-05-10 01:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(707877, 73657, 11181, '<td valign="top">Way to go!! Congrats!</td>', 'Way to go!! Congrats!', '2004-05-10 01:12:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(707879, 73747, 16148, '<td valign="top">Jean, I like your photos.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Jean, I like your photos.  Congratulations!', '2004-05-10 01:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
