(708343, 73328, 16154, '<td valign="top">I''m new so i still didn''t learn how to post comments... but here is the process:<br/>neatimage<br/>Contrast<br/>Greyscale<br/>cloned out residu around the small needle (thank you Aleks)<br/> <br/>This picture is a Billboard where I put needles, i cut one in half... and to put even more emphasis on the middle i used Labuda''s  Syringe to have that water drop :)<br/> <br/>thanks everyone!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-10 04:36:38.</i></td>', 'I''m new so i still didn''t learn how to post comments... but here is the process:neatimageContrastGreyscalecloned out residu around the small needle (thank you Aleks) This picture is a Billboard where I put needles, i cut one in half... and to put even more emphasis on the middle i used Labuda''s  Syringe to have that water drop :) thanks everyone!!!', '2004-05-10 05:34:51.000000', '2004-05-10 05:36:38.000000', 0),
