(710739, 73709, 10858, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your kind comments. I think the main problem was that I forgot to read the whole description and you know, I am not a big abstract photographer. :-) I should have payed more attention. F/11 wa sthe biggest aperture value I can use on my camera, so there was not much to do about the DOF. Maybe next time, thanks again. :-)</td>', 'Thank you all for your kind comments. I think the main problem was that I forgot to read the whole description and you know, I am not a big abstract photographer. :-) I should have payed more attention. F/11 wa sthe biggest aperture value I can use on my camera, so there was not much to do about the DOF. Maybe next time, thanks again. :-)', '2004-05-11 06:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
