(711782, 73512, 6870, '<td valign="top">I thought I commented on this one, but I guess not. This was one of my faves for this challenge. I gave it a healthy 9. It is so clear, balanced and interesting. Colors are so great, too. Your lighting is bright without being harsh--a great accomplishment in my book. Excellent work! That''s almost a ribbon!</td>', 'I thought I commented on this one, but I guess not. This was one of my faves for this challenge. I gave it a healthy 9. It is so clear, balanced and interesting. Colors are so great, too. Your lighting is bright without being harsh--a great accomplishment in my book. Excellent work! That''s almost a ribbon!', '2004-05-11 16:10:27.000000', NULL, 0),
